                                                                                
************************************************************************        
***                                                                    *        
***PROGRAM    :  W4404600                                              *        
***                                                                    *        
***FUNKTION   :  SKAPAR INFO                                          *         
***              VID RO PÅ LDC-ARTIKLAR                                *        
***                                                                    *        
***FÖRFATTARE :  JAN PETTERSSON                                        *        
***                                                                    *        
***           :                                                        *        
***                                                                    *        
***   DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
***   020304      ÅKE REINHOLDSSON         9233                        *        
***   ......      ..................       ......                      *        
***                                                                    *        
************************************************************************        
*IST OFF                                                                        
                                                                                
FILE W44046D1                                                                   
%W44046    'IN-'                                                                
IN-ARTNR    1   5  P   MASK 'ZZZZZZZ99'                                         
IN-RODAT    6   4  P   MASK 'Z999999'                                           
IN-DISTR   10   3  P   MASK 'ZZZ99'                                             
IN-KUNDNR  13   4  P   MASK 'ZZZZ999'                                           
                                                                                
FILE W44046D2  PRINTER FB(121 121)                                              
                                                                                
%WDATKORT 'DATKORT-'                                                            
                                                                                
*--------------------------*                                                    
* DATAREA                  *                                                    
*--------------------------*                                                    
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WDATAREA                                                                       
                                                                                
*--------------------------*                                                    
* DAGAREA                  *                                                    
*--------------------------*                                                    
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WDAGAREA                                                                       
                                                                                
  PROGRAM-NAMN          W  6 A   VALUE 'W44046'                                 
  DATUMKORT-ID          W  6 A   VALUE 'WDATUM'                                 
  WDATKONV              W  8 A   VALUE 'WDATKONV'                               
                                                                                
******************************************************                          
***           HJÄLP AREOR                          ***                          
******************************************************                          
  DD-TIAAVVD                          W   5  N                                  
  DD-TIAA             DD-TIAAVVD          2  N                                  
  DD-TIVV             DD-TIAAVVD      +2  2  N                                  
  DD-TID              DD-TIAAVVD      +2  1  N                                  
                                                                                
  DAGENS-DATUM        W                     6   N                               
  DAGENS-DATUM-AA     DAGENS-DATUM          2   N                               
  DAGENS-DATUM-MM     DAGENS-DATUM      +2  2   N                               
  DAGENS-DATUM-DD     DAGENS-DATUM      +4  2   N                               
                                                                                
******************************************************                          
***           HJÄLP AREA                           ***                          
******************************************************                          
W-ANTAL      W   3   P                                                          
*                                                                               
******************************************************                          
 JOB INPUT W44046D1              +                                              
           START A-INIT          +                                              
           FINISH Z-FINISH       +                                              
           NAME  STEG01                                                         
*     SKRIV LISTAN                                                              
    IF W-ANTAL < 100                                                            
      PRINT RAPPORT                                                             
       W-ANTAL = W-ANTAL + 1                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
                                                                                
*  HÄMTA DATUM FRÅN DATKORT                                                     
                                                                                
   CALL DATKORT USING (PROGRAM-NAMN +                                           
                       DATUMKORT-ID +                                           
                       DATKORT-DATUMKORT)                                       
                                                                                
   MOVE DATKORT-D-AAR    TO DAGENS-DATUM-AA                                     
   MOVE DATKORT-D-MAANAD TO DAGENS-DATUM-MM                                     
   MOVE DATKORT-D-DAG    TO DAGENS-DATUM-DD                                     
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
Z-FINISH. PROC                                                                  
                                                                                
*  SKRIV LISTA ÄVEN OM POSTER SAKNAS                                            
                                                                                
   IF W-ANTAL = 0                                                               
      DISPLAY W44046D2 NEWPAGE +                                                
         COL 01 SYSDATE                                                         
      DISPLAY W44046D2         +                                                
         COL 41 'VOLVO CAR CUSTOMER SERVICE       W44046-001'                   
      DISPLAY W44046D2         +                                                
         COL 45 'LDC LISTA   RESTORDER               '                          
      DISPLAY W44046D2 SKIP 3  +                                                
         COL 11 'INGA POSTER PÅ LISTAN IDAG          '                          
   END-IF                                                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
******************                                                              
*RAPPORTER       *                                                              
******************                                                              
                                                                                
REPORT RAPPORT                                                  +               
       PRINTER W44046D2                                         +               
       LINESIZE 120                                             +               
       SPACE 1                                                  +               
       PAGESIZE 41                                                              
                                                                                
SEQUENCE IN-DISTR IN-RODAT D IN-KUNDNR IN-ARTNR                                 
                                                                                
*ONTROL                                                                         
                                                                                
TITLE 1  '   '                                                                  
                                                                                
TITLE 2  '    VOLVO CAR CUSTOMER SERVICE       W44046-001'                      
                                                                                
                                                                                
TITLE 3  '    LDC LISTA   RESTORDER               '                             
                                                                                
HEADING  IN-RODAT             ('RO DATUM')                                      
HEADING  IN-DISTR             ('DISTRIKT')                                      
HEADING  IN-KUNDNR            ('KUND NR')                                       
HEADING  IN-IDORDNR5          ('ORDER NR')                                      
HEADING  IN-ARTNR             ('ARTIKEL NR')                                    
HEADING  IN-BEART-SVE         ('BENÄMNING')                                     
HEADING  IN-KVART             ('ANTAL')                                         
HEADING  IN-BERADREF          ('RAD REFERENS')                                  
HEADING  IN-IDDC              ('DC')                                            
                                                                                
LINE 01  IN-RODAT              +                                                
         IN-DISTR              +                                                
         IN-KUNDNR             +                                                
         IN-IDORDNR5           +                                                
         IN-ARTNR              +                                                
         IN-BEART-SVE          +                                                
         IN-KVART              +                                                
         IN-BERADREF           +                                                
         IN-IDDC                                                                
